# Brand design system

Before UI or styling work, read and follow
[`docs/brand-design-system.md`](docs/brand-design-system.md).

Do not invent parallel visual systems (colors, typefaces, button styles, or section theming).
Use semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, …) and existing classes
(`.btn-primary`, `.card-base`, `.section`, `.section-container`).
